{"id":1061304,"name":"霁川·审查Ⅳ","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"霁川·审查Ⅳ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1061304]}],"trial":{"trial_id":61304,"stage":"阶段4","unlock_time":"2026-05-07 14:00:00","diary1":"霁川被判定为高度异化却保有清醒意识的罕见样本。甫一抵达狄斯，班彦的专家团队就已集结完毕，与她一同进入了封闭抢救室。\n　　这场漫长又特殊的治疗，不止你在等待结果。千里之外，平安镇的灯火下，老人孩子们传颂着朔雪山庄庄主的传说故事，彻夜未眠。","diary2":"霁川的身体未能完全康复。狂厄对身体的侵蚀无法短时间逆转痊愈。但她已能缓缓下床，可以说笑，偶尔也能试着与你短暂并肩。\n　　你与霜儿曾经畅想的仗剑天涯的远景，渐渐有了轮廓。那个只存在于话本中的侠义江湖，仿佛就在几步之外。","evidence":[{"ID":260903,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260904,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161304001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161304002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161304003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161304004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161304005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161304006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161304007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161304008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161304009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161304010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161304011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161304012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161304013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161304014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161304015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161304016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161304017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161304018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161304019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":7,"dialogue_id":161304020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161304021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161304022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161304023,"next":null},{"step":24,"course":2,"dialogue_id":